  {
   "id": "ev24405A_013",
   "idx": [
    13
   ],
   "jp": "{8002}{8602}{9498}「よ、良かったんだな～！{8207}これで安心して食べられるんだな！{8207}もぐもぐもぐもぐ・・・」{8400}{8100}",
   "en": "{8002}{8602}{9498}Th-that's a relief, y'know! Now I can eat without worrying, y'know! Munch munch munch munch...{8400}{8100}",
   "status": "translated"
