   "status": "translated"
  },
  {
   "id": "ev24405A_015",
   "idx": [
    15
   ],
   "jp": "{8002}{8611}{9497}「ハァハァ・・・{8207}たっ・・・大変よ！{8207}シズクがどこにもいないの！！」{8400}{8100}",
   "en": "{8002}{8611}{9497}Huff, huff... Th-this is bad! Shizuku is nowhere to be found!!{8400}{8100}",
   "status": "translated"
  },
  {
   "id": "ev24405A_016",
   "idx": [
    16
   ],
   "jp": "{8002}{8612}{9498}「ええ！？{8207}なんで～！どうして～～～！？」{8400}{8100}",
   "en": "{8002}{8612}{9498}Whaaat?! Why~! How come~~~?!{8400}{8100}",
   "status": "translated"
  },
  {
   "id": "ev24405A_017",
   "idx": [
    17
   ],
   "jp": "{8002}{8611}{9497}「そんなの・・・アタシにも{8207}わかんないわよ・・・」{8400}{8100}",
   "en": "{8002}{8611}{9497}How should I... know that...?{8400}{8100}",
   "status": "translated"
  },
  {
   "id": "ev24405A_018",
   "idx": [
    18
   ],
   "jp": "{8002}{8610}{9497}「あっ・・・もしかしたら・・・{8207}シズク、町の人達が言っていた事を{8207}気にして・・・」{8300}{8610}{9497}「一人でバミューダの所に行ったんじゃ！」{8400}{8100}",
   "en": "{8002}{8610}{9497}Oh... Maybe... Shizuku took what the townspeople said to heart...{8300}{8610}{9497}...and went to Bermuda's place all by herself!{8400}{8100}",
   "status": "translated"
  },
  {
